          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. What is the total amount Krithika has, if she has the following numbers of notes of ₹100, ₹20 and ₹5? Complete the following table:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.141,
            0.205,
            0.157
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.159,
            0.872,
            0.434
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 2,
              "bbox": [
                0.121,
                0.159,
                0.872,
                0.434
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_26_table_2.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tr><td>No. of100Notes</td><td>No. of 20notes</td><td>No. of ₹5notes</td><td>Expression and total amount(in ₹)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>5</td><td>6</td><td><eq>\\begin{array}{c}3 \\times 100 + 5 \\times 20 + 6 \\times 5 \\\\= 430\\end{array}</eq></td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>4</td><td>3</td><td><eq>\\begin{aligned}6 \\times 100 + 4 \\times 20 + 3 \\times 5 \\\\= 695\\end{aligned}</eq></td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>4</td><td>Z</td><td><eq>\\begin{array} { c } { 8 \\times 1 0 0 + 4 \\times 2 0 + z \\times 5 } \\\\ { = 8 8 0 + 5 z } \\end{array}</eq></td></tr><tr><td>X</td><td>y</td><td>Z</td><td><eq>\\begin{array}{c}x \\times 100 + y \\times 20 + z \\times 5 \\\\= 100x + 20y + 5z\\end{array}</eq></td></tr></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.473,
            0.883,
            0.583
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. Venkatalakshmi owns a flour mill. It takes 10 seconds for the roller mill to start running. Once it is running, each kg of grain takes 8 seconds to grind into powder. Which of the expressions below describes the time taken to complete grind ‘y’ kg of grain, assuming the machine is off initially?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.178,
            0.599,
            0.308,
            0.619
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10+8+y"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.359,
            0.599,
            0.669,
            0.619
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "(10 + 8) \\times y"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (c) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathbf { 1 0 \\times 8 \\times y }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.178,
            0.633,
            0.309,
            0.652
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(d) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 0 + 8 \\times y"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.36,
            0.633,
            0.489,
            0.652
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 0 \\times y + 8"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.67,
            0.331,
            0.689
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (d) 10 + 8 × y"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.706,
            0.883,
            0.77
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. Write algebraic expressions using letters of your choice. (a) 5 more than a number (b) 4 less than a number (c) 2 less than 13 times a number (d) 13 less than 2 times a number",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.788,
            0.205,
            0.805
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.8,
            0.594,
            0.914
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let letter ‘d’ represent the number, then (a) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "d + 5"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (b) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "d - 4"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (c) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 3 \\times d - 2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (d) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 \\times d - 1 3"
            }
          ]
        },
